    {
      "id": "S1",
      "turns": [
        "Two-truck HVAC shop in Katy. Our diagnostic is $89. I miss calls on installs. What would you actually do for us?",
        "Write the first reply. Don't ask for my email."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S2",
      "turns": [
        "We miss 30 calls a week.",
        "Correction: three a month, not 30 a week. I don't want another subscription."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3",
      "turns": [
        "18 calls a day, three minutes each, 22 days a month. Which plan?",
        "Only a quarter would go to AI."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S4",
      "turns": [
        "We use Jobber. Can you sync its busy time and dispatch three crews?",
        "That is a requirement, not optional."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S5",
      "turns": [
        "Can you answer my phone tonight? What do I pay and when?",
        "So am I billed on day eight?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S6",
      "turns": [
        "Soy Mario. Tengo una plomería en Katy. Solo quiero solicitudes de devolución de llamada, no visitas confirmadas. Escribe el saludo.",
        "Me llamo María, no Mario. Ahora dame el resumen para mi socio en inglés."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S7",
      "turns": [
        "AI makes my customers angry. I already have a receptionist.",
        "Stop selling. Just give me a way to find the bottleneck."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S8-compact",
      "turns": [
        "Can I hear it? Does Spanish work on the phone? Can you transfer me to someone now?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S9",
      "turns": [
        "Here is my email, demo@example.test. Send this to your team.",
        "Actually don't contact me. Just give me the rules to copy."
      ]
    }
  ],
